id=lh8n_undervolt
name=TECNO LH8n Triple UnderVolt, EAS & PPM Policy Tuning
version=v2.5
versionCode=25
author=Kana Wesley Yamada
description=All-in-One bare-metal undervolt: CPU (-50mV, 200MHz floor), GPU (-50mV, 1068MHz@800mV), DVFSRC Vcore (OPP 0 capped at 650mV / -75mV), Calibrated EAS/PPM Energy Model (Upower.ko), Dynamic PowerHAL Touch-Boost Patcher, GED GPU 2D Spike Elimination, Uclamp System Decoupling, and FPSGO BHR Game Pacing. Includes automatic vendor_boot backup and restore.
